===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|broadcast|t1=to transmit a message or signal through radio waves or electronic means|er|pos2={{glossary|suffix}} forming {{glossary|agent noun}}s}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=23509|date=December 2022|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref>

