===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|agriculture}}
## A [[machine#Noun|machine]] [[use#Verb|used]] to [[broadcast#Verb|broadcast]] or [[spread#Verb|spread]] [[seed#Noun|seeds]], [[fertilizer]], etc.
## {{lb|en|obsolete}} A [[person#Noun|person]] who [[sow#Verb|sows]] seeds by [[scattering#Noun|scattering]]; also, one who [[promote]]s sowing seeds in this [[manner#Noun|manner]] instead of by {{l|en|drilling|t=[[make#Verb|making]] [[hole#Noun|holes]] in the [[soil#Noun|soil]] and [[place#Verb|placing]] seeds in them}}.
##: {{antonyms|en|driller}}
# {{lb|en|broadcasting}}
## A [[piece#Noun|piece]] of [[equipment]] used to [[transmit]] [[audio#Noun|audio]] and/or [[video#Noun|video]] [[content#Noun|content]], or [[message#Noun|messages]], to be [[receive]]d by [[radio#Noun|radios]] or [[television#Noun|televisions]], over the [[internet]], etc.
## An [[organization]] or [[station#Noun|station]] that [[engage]]s in the [[activity]] of such [[broadcasting#Noun|broadcasting]].
## A person whose [[job#Noun|job]] it is to [[effect#Verb|effect]] such broadcasts; specifically, one who [[present#Verb|presents]] radio or television [[programme#Noun|programmes]] (especially [[documentary|documentaries]] or [[news#Noun|news]] programmes); a [[presenter]].
# {{lb|en|computing}} A piece of equipment used to transmit [[datum|data]] over a [[computer network]].

